{"id":"121214","name":"东北酸菜","author":"食·色","authorId":"34360","desc":"","cover":"images/121214/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大白菜","amount":"1500克"},{"name":"酸菜乳酸菌","amount":"1包"},{"name":"凉开水","amount":"1800毫升"},{"name":"盐","amount":"3勺"},{"name":"糖","amount":"6勺"}],"sub":[]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备用料","img":"images/121214/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"白菜洗净，切成四瓣","img":"images/121214/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用开水烫30-60秒，","img":"images/121214/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"沥水晾凉","img":"images/121214/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"将盐，糖，乳酸菌，水倒入大碗","img":"images/121214/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀","img":"images/121214/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"白菜放入酸菜机容器","img":"images/121214/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入发酵汁","img":"images/121214/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"用压菜板压实","img":"images/121214/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加盖，放入酸菜机","img":"images/121214/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"启动酸菜功能","img":"images/121214/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"发酵完成，开机","img":"images/121214/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"揭盖","img":"images/121214/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品","img":"images/121214/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"没有乳酸菌也可以不放，只不过使用乳酸菌可以加速发酵过程，缩短发酵时间\n本食谱所用量勺为酸菜机随机配置的量勺。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}